<title>FRANCE: France sells 451 mln Ecu OATs at auction.</title>
<headline>France sells 451 mln Ecu OATs at auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury sold the following government bonds (OATs) at auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 25.APR.07	5.50	   451 MLN	    6.15</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 1.400 BLN/3.1		    NIL		 95.26</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 60.0						     21.MAY</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT AUCTION</p>
<p>							     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - The Treasury originally announced it would sell 300 to 500 million Ecu of OATs in total.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5542</p>
</text>
